[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238914\">7050A19</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238844\">7040H42</a>\n                                           (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238846\">7040H80</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolt securing the bottom end of the seat belt.</p><p>2. Undo the bolt fixing the winder.</p><p>3. Remove the seat belt.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019508.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the seat belt is\nundamaged.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>If the seat belt has been subjected\nto great stress, e.g. following an accident, it must be replaced\nas a complete unit together with its anchorages and the  retaining\nbolts. Even if the seat belt does not show signs of visible defects,\nit may have lost its strength properties.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>1. Fit the seat belt.</p><p>2. Tighten the winder retaining bolt.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>REAR SEAT BELT REEL.</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>3.6 - 4.4</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Tighten the bolt securing the seat belt end.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Lower bolt</p></td><td></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>3.6 - 4.4</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019509.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3238846\">7040H80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238844\">7040H42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238914\">7050A19</a></p>"],[2047,127,65536,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238813\">7040B22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238809\">7040B15</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238814\">7040B28</a></p><p><strong>- 7040L44 rear compartment scuff strip - r r</strong></p><p><a href=\"#/3238928\">7050A47</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238816\">7040B30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238807\">7040B06</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolt securing the bottom end of the seat belt.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019510.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,65536,"<p>1. Remove the embellishment.</p><p>2. Undo the nut.</p><p>3. Move the seat belt relay.</p><p>4. Unscrew the winder retaining bolt.</p><p>5. Remove the seat belt.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019511.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,65536,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the seat belt is undamaged.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>If the seat belt has been subjected\nto great stress, e.g. following an accident, it must be replaced\nas a complete unit together with its anchorages and the  retaining\nbolts. Even if the seat belt does not show signs of visible defects,\nit may have lost its strength properties.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>1. Fit the seat belt winder.</p><p>2. Tighten the bolt.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>REAR SEAT BELT REEL.</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Fit the seat belt relay.</p><p>4. Tighten the nut.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>REAR SEAT BELT IDLER</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>5. Fit the embellishment.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019512.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,65536,"<p>1. Fit the bottom end of the seat belt.</p><p>2. Tighten the bolt.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.0</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019513.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,65536,"<p><a href=\"#/3238807\">7040B06</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238816\">7040B30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238928\">7050A47</a></p><p><strong>- 7040L44 rear compartment scuff strip - r r</strong></p><p><a href=\"#/3238814\">7040B28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238809\">7040B15</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238813\">7040B22</a></p>"]]